SKILL MANAGEMENT PLATFORM
Simple Business Requirement Document | Discussion Draft
Recommended approach: Power Apps Canvas App + SharePoint + Power Automate + Power BI
1. Purpose and Objective
Create a central Skill Management Platform to capture employee capabilities, assess proficiency, track certifications and learning, identify skill gaps, and match available capability with project demand. The first version should be simple, scalable and suitable for phased enhancement.
